# Project scope

- This repo is the Hiilipörssi Odoo 20 Community prototype. Odoo version: 20.0.
- Odoo core comes from the official Docker image `odoo:20.0`. Never clone, fork, or copy Odoo core into this repo.
- Only custom addons live in `addons/`. Technical module names use the `hp_` prefix.
- The local environment is defined in `compose.yaml`. Use it; do not set up a separate Odoo install (venv, source checkout).
- Enterprise is not used yet. Never copy Enterprise code into this repo, and do not reference Enterprise modules in any manifest.
- Production hosting is not decided. Do not add deployment config without asking.
- Keep README.md and these rules in English.

Example: a new feature goes in `addons/hp_feature/`, not in a patched copy of Odoo core.
